---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
List your workspaces, with their organization, or with --joinable the ones you can join.
Prints one line per workspace with its id; give the id or part of its name in the next command.

USAGE
  holst workspace ls [flags]

FLAGS
  --joinable   List the workspaces you can join, not your own

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst ws ls
  $ holst ws ls --joinable

LEARN MORE
  How a workspace is given: `holst ws -h`.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
